                                                "sense_id": "1408822d-2f10-3887-8c49-07b484cbe800",
                                                "text": "In the firſt Courſe there was a Shoulder of Mutton, cut into an Æquilateral Triangle, a Piece of Beef into a Rhomboides, and a Pudding into a Cycloid."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
